    ],
    "text": "9. The Corporation shall be able and capable in law toacquire and hold any property, movable or immovable whichmay become vested in it by virtue of any purchase, grant,lease, gift, testamentary disposition or otherwise and all suchproperty shall be held by the Corporation for the purposes ofthis Act and subject to the rules in force for the time being ofthe Corporation, with full power to sell, mortgage, lease,exchange or otherwise dispose of the same.",
